## TIẾNG ANH · 16:30–17:00 — Thứ Sáu: Nhìn lại tuần

### 16:30–16:40 · Shadowing

### 16:40–17:00 · Nói to có ghi âm — 3 phút

> **1. What I did**
> *"Performance week. I started by measuring everything and refusing to change any code until I had a baseline. Then I fixed re-renders, cut the bundle, and improved perceived performance with skeletons and image placeholders."*
>
> **2. The most useful thing**
> *"Testing on a low-end device. Everything felt fine on a flagship, but cold start on a two-gigabyte Android was ___ times slower. Most users in Vietnam aren't on flagships, so that's the number that actually matters."*
>
> **3. What surprised me**
> *"___ didn't help at all, even though I expected it to. I've written that down alongside the wins, because knowing what doesn't work is worth just as much."*
>
> **4. Next week**
> *"Offline-first and CI/CD. I want the app usable with no network, and GitHub Actions running lint, typecheck and tests on every pull request."*

**Kiêm buổi họp một mình.** Tự hỏi bằng tiếng Việt: tuần này vai trò nào bị bỏ rơi?

